# Theme Architecture Rules

This project is a theme engine.

Themes are presentation layers only.

Business logic must be global.

## Themes Can Contain

* Layouts
* Styling
* Animations
* Visual components
* Theme-specific UI

## Themes Cannot Contain

* API calls
* Business logic
* Data transformation
* Validation
* State management
* Shared utilities
* Shared hooks

## Feature Development

Any feature added to one theme should be implemented globally first.

All themes must be able to consume the same feature.

Never duplicate logic across themes.

## Reuse Policy

Before creating:

* Component
* Hook
* Service
* Utility

Search the project first.

Prefer:

1. Reuse
2. Extend
3. Refactor

Never copy-paste code.

## Golden Rule

One Logic.
Many Themes.
Zero Duplication.
